      "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 6104 recorded a gross prioryear release of $15.83m in 2024 (approximately 29.8% of the opening gross claims outstanding of $53.08m). Management attributes this primarily to releases of Covid19 related reserves from older years of account and prioryear catastrophe reserve releases (including Hurricane Ian and Typhoon Jebi). These favourable reserve developments helped offset current year losses such as Hurricanes Helene and Milton and the Baltimore bridge loss. The movements principally affect the Syndicate's reinsurance/property catastrophe exposures.",
